WEBVTT

00:00:00.860 --> 00:00:03.270
There, all done.

00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:06.350
Wow, thank you, Sella!

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:09.080
You know how to put yukatas on, Sella?

00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:12.990
Of course. For a maid, it's a basic skill.

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:12.990
Liar.

00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:15.240
You looked it up last night in a panic.

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:19.160
I was just double checking!

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:20.960
Sounds like everyone's here.

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:23.330
Yeah! It's a festival! A festival!

00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:25.900
Be careful while you're out.

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:26.920
Take care.

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:28.990
We're off!

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:06.350
<b>Episode 5 
Yukatas and Fireworks</b>

00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:09.610
Come on, hurry up, Tohsaka Rin.

00:02:09.610 --> 00:02:11.480
Jeez, so haughty...

00:02:11.820 --> 00:02:17.360
Really, the times you wear Japanese clothing 
are the only times I envy your barrel body.

00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:23.030
Actually, why don't you wear 
Japanese clothes all the time?

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:26.390
Hey, Luvia...

00:02:26.390 --> 00:02:27.540
What is it?

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:32.110
When you're wearing a yukata, 
you're not allowed to wear underwear.

00:02:32.110 --> 00:02:32.960
Did you know that?

00:02:32.960 --> 00:02:35.500
Huh? I've never heard of such a rule...

00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:39.260
Well, yukatas are traditional 
Japanese pajamas, right?

00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:42.390
So, generally speaking, you don't 
wear underwear with them.

00:02:42.910 --> 00:02:44.170
I understand...

00:02:44.170 --> 00:02:48.920
Sometimes, your chimpanzee 
brain comes in handy.

00:02:49.890 --> 00:02:51.990
Oh, it's nothing.

00:02:55.720 --> 00:02:57.430
This is a nice atmosphere.

00:02:57.430 --> 00:03:00.850
This festival is pretty famous around this area.

00:03:01.270 --> 00:03:03.920
Seems people from other 
cities come to see it, too.

00:03:03.920 --> 00:03:06.240
There's also a fireworks show at night.

00:03:06.740 --> 00:03:08.580
I can't wait!

00:03:09.900 --> 00:03:10.890
Miyu?

00:03:11.940 --> 00:03:13.420
What, Illya?

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:17.300
I know you might be confused 
with all these unusual stands,

00:03:17.300 --> 00:03:19.910
but events like this are really fun.

00:03:19.910 --> 00:03:20.550
Oh...

00:03:20.550 --> 00:03:24.360
If there's anything you don't 
understand, just ask me!

00:03:24.360 --> 00:03:27.060
Thanks. Then, first off...

00:03:28.060 --> 00:03:30.320
<b>Cotton Candy
500 Yen</b>

00:03:28.470 --> 00:03:29.510
What's that?

00:03:31.220 --> 00:03:35.730
That's called cotton candy. 
It's really fluffy and sweet.

00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:37.620
That should be a simple item,

00:03:37.620 --> 00:03:40.650
made by melting sugar and 
working it into a cotton-like form.

00:03:41.020 --> 00:03:46.370
The price of the sugar alone is only a few yen, 
and with packaging, only a few tens of yen.

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:50.090
Assuming the cost to the 
seller is 25% of the price,

00:03:50.090 --> 00:03:51.790
then 200 yen would be appropriate,

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:54.270
so that retail price is clearly too high.

00:03:55.110 --> 00:03:56.290
Then why

00:03:56.610 --> 00:03:59.050
are so many people buying it?

00:03:59.050 --> 00:04:03.260
Wait! I don't understand what you're asking!

00:04:03.260 --> 00:04:05.720
Sorry, I'll make it simple.

00:04:05.720 --> 00:04:07.760
Yes, please.

00:04:08.400 --> 00:04:09.800
That stand is...

00:04:09.800 --> 00:04:11.140
That stand is?

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:13.940
It's ripping people off.

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:17.040
Choose your words more carefully, Miyu!

00:04:18.480 --> 00:04:21.460
E-Excuse us!

00:04:26.190 --> 00:04:28.160
What have you two been doing?

00:04:28.160 --> 00:04:31.750
Illya was answering my 
questions about the stands.

00:04:32.260 --> 00:04:33.410
Questions?

00:04:33.410 --> 00:04:36.750
About the cost percentage and fair retail price.

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:39.340
Wh-Why would you think about that?

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:41.920
You think about some difficult things...

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:44.130
That one, too.

00:04:44.610 --> 00:04:48.780
With 200 yen, you could make 
a dozen of those toys.

00:04:48.780 --> 00:04:51.850
But the consumers are lining up for them.

00:04:52.340 --> 00:04:53.840
I don't understand their reasoning.

00:04:53.840 --> 00:04:58.730
Um... A festival isn't something 
you think about like that...

00:04:58.730 --> 00:05:02.480
You can't calculate the fun 
you have at a festival!

00:05:02.480 --> 00:05:03.860
Tatsuko?

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:06.320
Wh-Wh-What are you doing?

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:07.700
Watch closely!

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:11.720
This is my way of enjoying a festival!

00:05:13.140 --> 00:05:15.510
H-Hey, she went face-first.

00:05:15.510 --> 00:05:16.760
Is she all right?

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:22.600
No way!

00:05:22.600 --> 00:05:23.510
She's unharmed?

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:27.800
I can't have you underestimating 
my mastery at falling!

00:05:30.090 --> 00:05:31.560
Tatsuko-chan?

00:05:33.160 --> 00:05:36.060
Festival! Festival! Festival!

00:05:36.430 --> 00:05:39.680
I just hope Tatsuko-chan doesn't get hurt.

00:05:39.680 --> 00:05:41.820
Festivals sure change people.

00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:44.740
No, in Tattsun's case, I'm pretty sure that's natural.

00:05:45.630 --> 00:05:49.570
If that's the proper way of enjoying a festival...

00:05:50.110 --> 00:05:52.950
I'm not sure I'll be able to do it well.

00:05:54.270 --> 00:05:57.730
T-Tatsuko's method is a bit more advanced.

00:05:57.730 --> 00:05:58.750
But...

00:06:00.310 --> 00:06:01.660
Don't worry.

00:06:01.660 --> 00:06:05.260
I'll show you how most people enjoy a festival.

00:06:09.200 --> 00:06:10.010
Okay.

00:06:11.570 --> 00:06:12.850
All right, I caught it!

00:06:12.850 --> 00:06:14.880
Nanaki-chan, careful.

00:06:16.740 --> 00:06:18.730
I wonder which I should get...

00:06:19.590 --> 00:06:22.530
Hey, Miyu, how many do you plan to scoop?

00:06:22.530 --> 00:06:24.320
Incredible, Miyu!

00:06:28.590 --> 00:06:30.690
That's a new texture!

00:06:39.070 --> 00:06:40.120
This next one!

00:06:40.950 --> 00:06:41.870
Hey, Kuro!

00:06:41.870 --> 00:06:43.250
Don't get in my way!

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:43.960
Illya...

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:53.470
How is it, Miyu? Having fun?

00:06:54.390 --> 00:06:55.880
It's not so bad.

00:06:56.750 --> 00:06:58.270
Right?

00:06:59.050 --> 00:07:00.560
You seem to be having fun, too.

00:07:01.760 --> 00:07:03.290
Of course!

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:05.840
Still, you're a weird one, Illya.

00:07:05.840 --> 00:07:06.740
Huh?

00:07:06.740 --> 00:07:11.140
That. Why do you have that toy, 
when you already have the real thing?

00:07:11.140 --> 00:07:13.370
They're two different things!

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:16.790
With this, I'm Magical Bushido Musashi!

00:07:17.400 --> 00:07:19.830
Illya-san, you cheat!

00:07:19.830 --> 00:07:21.000
Huh? Ruby?

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:23.490
You like younger girls that much?

00:07:23.490 --> 00:07:25.710
Have you grown tired of an old thing like me?

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:28.510
Throwing me out, after using me as you pleased?

00:07:28.510 --> 00:07:29.760
What are you saying?

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:31.390
You homewrecker!

00:07:31.390 --> 00:07:33.810
Nobody asked you to come here!

00:07:33.810 --> 00:07:34.850
Go away!

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:36.070
Give it up!

00:07:36.070 --> 00:07:40.080
There's no room for you to butt 
in between me and Illya-san!

00:07:40.080 --> 00:07:43.330
Wearing a mask is a bit childish.

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:43.330
If you're too persistent, I'll dig things up!

00:07:43.330 --> 00:07:46.020
The next time we meet will be in court!

00:07:49.300 --> 00:07:50.240
Miyu-sama...

00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:51.270
Sapphire?

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:54.700
Miyu-sama, you would never 
be unfaithful, would you?

00:07:55.050 --> 00:07:56.990
Of course I wouldn't.

00:07:57.290 --> 00:07:59.660
I've never had eyes for anyone but Illya.

00:08:02.770 --> 00:08:04.710
Oh! Look, look!

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:05.480
Hmm?

00:08:05.480 --> 00:08:06.170
What is it?

00:08:06.170 --> 00:08:09.290
The prizes at that stand 
are incredibly luxurious!

00:08:09.290 --> 00:08:10.630
Wow, incredible!

00:08:10.630 --> 00:08:12.660
Want to give it a try?

00:08:12.660 --> 00:08:15.090
No, there's no way you can win those.

00:08:15.090 --> 00:08:19.060
The strings are never attached 
to any good prizes.

00:08:19.380 --> 00:08:20.880
That's not true.

00:08:20.880 --> 00:08:22.480
You should have faith in the proprietor—

00:08:24.050 --> 00:08:24.940
Welcome.

00:08:24.940 --> 00:08:27.690
<i>An awful person's running the stand!</i>

00:08:27.990 --> 00:08:30.570
Huh? The lady who was selling
popsicles at the beach?

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:32.640
She has a stand here, too?

00:08:32.640 --> 00:08:35.070
Excuse me. I'd like a try, please.

00:08:35.520 --> 00:08:37.020
That'll be 500 yen apiece.

00:08:40.340 --> 00:08:41.670
A miss, huh?

00:08:41.670 --> 00:08:42.920
Me, too.

00:08:42.920 --> 00:08:44.000
What a shame...

00:08:44.430 --> 00:08:46.670
What do we get for this?

00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:49.920
Well...

00:08:52.590 --> 00:08:53.470
Here.

00:08:58.730 --> 00:08:59.680
What's this?

00:09:00.340 --> 00:09:01.680
The consolation prize.

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:05.190
Huh? But isn't that usually candy or small toys?

00:09:05.190 --> 00:09:08.490
I have no intention of giving 
merchandise to one who fails!

00:09:09.070 --> 00:09:11.930
That's a pretty literal consolation prize...

00:09:11.930 --> 00:09:15.250
Let's go eat some shaved ice 
to cheer ourselves up.

00:09:15.250 --> 00:09:16.910
Yeah...

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:18.760
Now... You, too!

00:09:20.350 --> 00:09:22.150
Wh-What should we do?

00:09:22.560 --> 00:09:24.540
Considering what happened at the beach,

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:27.920
I think it's highly likely there isn't a winner.

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:31.420
500 yen per try! Three draws for 1,500 yen!

00:09:31.610 --> 00:09:33.590
She's really looming over us!

00:09:33.590 --> 00:09:34.880
This is how she pressures a sale?

00:09:34.880 --> 00:09:36.340
<i>Trace, on.</i>

00:09:37.120 --> 00:09:38.770
<i>Tracing fundamental structure.</i>

00:09:39.390 --> 00:09:40.970
<i>Tracing component materials.</i>

00:09:40.970 --> 00:09:42.600
What are you doing?

00:09:42.980 --> 00:09:46.290
What? Just analyzing it through ma—

00:09:47.320 --> 00:09:49.230
Saying a charm to help me win the draw.

00:09:49.230 --> 00:09:51.570
That definitely wasn't a charm, was it?

00:09:51.890 --> 00:09:56.030
What? I only confirmed whether 
this even has a winner.

00:09:56.030 --> 00:09:59.720
There are still things you 
should and shouldn't do!

00:09:59.720 --> 00:10:02.530
So you're telling me to just ignore this scam?

00:10:02.860 --> 00:10:05.210
I won't stand for you calling this a scam.

00:10:05.210 --> 00:10:06.770
Oh? It's not?

00:10:06.770 --> 00:10:11.590
My employer said, "Don't worry. No one will 
ever draw higher than second prize,"

00:10:11.590 --> 00:10:12.920
but this is no scam!

00:10:12.920 --> 00:10:14.800
That's definitely a scam!

00:10:14.800 --> 00:10:16.920
Well? How many will you draw?

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:19.910
Huh? Uh...

00:10:19.910 --> 00:10:21.770
Then I shall draw all of the remainder.

00:10:21.770 --> 00:10:23.720
Huh? Luvia-san?

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:28.480
In that case, it won't be a problem 
if we take everything home, right?

00:10:24.410 --> 00:10:25.580
Rin-san, too?

00:10:36.630 --> 00:10:37.690
No.

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:39.490
There's no problem there.

00:10:39.490 --> 00:10:42.520
If I sell all the draws, my employer 
should also be pleased.

00:10:45.320 --> 00:10:47.270
I'll prepare them for delivery.

00:10:47.990 --> 00:10:51.140
Honestly, she's such a simple musclehead.

00:10:51.140 --> 00:10:52.750
You said it.

00:10:53.310 --> 00:10:56.160
All of the prizes, for 500,000 yen...

00:10:56.570 --> 00:11:01.470
Even if it covers the amount of money wasted 
up to now, the excessive total expenditure...

00:11:01.470 --> 00:11:04.480
This is how to best enjoy a festival!

00:11:04.480 --> 00:11:05.660
Miyu?!

00:11:06.780 --> 00:11:08.570
Thank you very much.

00:11:08.570 --> 00:11:10.340
Not a problem at all.

00:11:10.340 --> 00:11:15.190
That's right. She only wanted to 
show off what a vulgar nouveau she is.

00:11:15.190 --> 00:11:18.300
My, my... I'm only hearing the distant howls

00:11:18.300 --> 00:11:21.240
of a so-called noble lacking 
the finances to show off.

00:11:21.240 --> 00:11:24.660
Says the self-proclaimed noble who 
can't even put on her own yukata!

00:11:24.660 --> 00:11:29.490
Hmph! A true noblewoman is one with 
a prestigious maid to help her dress.

00:11:29.490 --> 00:11:30.910
Oh? That's...

00:11:29.490 --> 00:11:32.230
Saying whatever you want, 
while I was holding back!

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:32.570
Blonde Ringlets and Pigtails!

00:11:32.230 --> 00:11:34.360
That's my line!

00:11:32.570 --> 00:11:34.010
Hey, Nanaki!

00:11:34.360 --> 00:11:37.900
Now, now, we're all here to have fun.

00:11:34.360 --> 00:11:37.900
In the first place, you've been nitpicking 
trivial things since this morning.

00:11:37.900 --> 00:11:40.190
Let's just let it drop for today.

00:11:37.900 --> 00:11:42.010
I only instructed you on the proper behavior 
a maid should show her master.

00:11:42.010 --> 00:11:43.500
Whatever.

00:11:43.500 --> 00:11:47.340
If our yukatas start coming undone, 
it will ruin everything.

00:11:47.340 --> 00:11:48.640
You're right.

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:49.670
Huh?

00:11:49.670 --> 00:11:52.270
It's unusual for them to avoid a fight.

00:11:52.270 --> 00:11:55.140
Good grief... If I weren't meeting Shero,

00:11:55.140 --> 00:11:57.160
I never would have attended 
a festival with this woman.

00:11:57.160 --> 00:11:58.650
It seems we agree for once.

00:12:00.090 --> 00:12:01.610
So that's why.

00:12:02.140 --> 00:12:03.320
Onii-chan!

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:06.780
Hey, everyone. Tohsaka and Luvia, too?

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:08.820
How do you do, Shero?

00:12:08.820 --> 00:12:13.830
W-Well, since we heard our 
classmate was helping with a stand,

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:16.620
I would've felt bad if we hadn't stopped by.

00:12:17.650 --> 00:12:18.550
Thanks.

00:12:18.550 --> 00:12:23.440
Wow. So Illya's brother is helping someone here?

00:12:23.440 --> 00:12:26.950
Yeah. They helped me out a lot
back at the beach hut.

00:12:26.950 --> 00:12:28.180
So I wanted to thank them.

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:30.340
Huh? The beach hut?

00:12:30.340 --> 00:12:31.850
You don't mean...

00:12:31.850 --> 00:12:34.660
Well, if it isn't Tatsuko's young friends!

00:12:34.660 --> 00:12:36.060
Nice to see you!

00:12:36.340 --> 00:12:38.520
<i>Tatsuko's father again?</i>

00:12:38.520 --> 00:12:41.860
During the summer, we do business 
here and at the beach hut!

00:12:43.180 --> 00:12:45.280
I don't really care, but...

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:48.860
I can't believe we're learning so much 
about Tattsun's home life...

00:12:48.860 --> 00:12:51.700
You're both being so mean 
without even thinking about it...

00:12:51.700 --> 00:12:54.870
Still, thanks for helping out.

00:12:54.870 --> 00:12:58.600
You're a good cook, you're considerate, 
and you're a hard worker!

00:12:58.600 --> 00:13:00.340
I can help out with this anytime.

00:13:00.600 --> 00:13:04.430
He's Shero, after all. That's only natural talent.

00:13:04.430 --> 00:13:06.450
Why are <i>you</i> boasting about it?

00:13:06.450 --> 00:13:09.370
With the beach hut, we were shorthanded.

00:13:09.370 --> 00:13:10.470
It's a big help!

00:13:10.470 --> 00:13:11.590
Huh?

00:13:11.590 --> 00:13:14.020
Then couldn't you have asked Tatsuko to help?

00:13:15.700 --> 00:13:17.980
No need to worry about that!

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:21.150
She helps out most by not being around!

00:13:21.150 --> 00:13:22.880
That's our Tatsuko.

00:13:22.880 --> 00:13:25.750
Even her big-hearted father 
says that about her...

00:13:27.260 --> 00:13:29.910
So, Onii-chan, you're still not done helping out?

00:13:30.160 --> 00:13:31.660
Oh, well...

00:13:31.660 --> 00:13:35.970
Yeah, my wife and kids should be arriving soon.

00:13:36.320 --> 00:13:38.110
You can call it a day, boy.

00:13:38.110 --> 00:13:40.460
Oh, okay. Thanks a lot.

00:13:41.020 --> 00:13:41.980
Yay!

00:13:41.980 --> 00:13:44.590
Then you can eat and watch 
the fireworks with us!

00:13:44.820 --> 00:13:47.800
Oh, right. Take these with you, then.

00:13:47.800 --> 00:13:49.010
Huh? Can we?

00:13:49.010 --> 00:13:50.050
Thanks!

00:13:50.320 --> 00:13:52.480
Hey, it's nothing.

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:57.040
Also, while you're at it, 
could you take her with you?

00:13:57.450 --> 00:14:00.360
Hey! I'm done carrying the shrine!

00:14:00.600 --> 00:14:03.540
I can't believe he's pushing Tatsuko away so hard.

00:14:03.540 --> 00:14:06.570
She must have done something awful in the past.

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:08.930
I'm reminded of that nightmare in Home Ec.

00:14:09.490 --> 00:14:11.920
That made my head ache.

00:14:11.920 --> 00:14:14.540
Really? Mine was perfectly fine.

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:18.290
And here I thought I could finally 
hang out with Onii-chan...

00:14:15.060 --> 00:14:17.400
Sure that isn't because your head's empty?

00:14:19.010 --> 00:14:20.600
She's talking about you.

00:14:19.010 --> 00:14:21.420
Rin and Luvia took him from us.

00:14:21.990 --> 00:14:26.010
Sorry I could only join you for part of it, 
after you asked me to come.

00:14:26.310 --> 00:14:27.820
Don't worry about it.

00:14:27.820 --> 00:14:29.130
That's right.

00:14:29.130 --> 00:14:33.220
In fact, I'd say you're diligent and 
commendable for fulfilling your job.

00:14:33.470 --> 00:14:36.600
That's something I'd like that 
useless maid to learn from.

00:14:37.710 --> 00:14:40.560
Yes, perhaps I should learn from him.

00:14:40.850 --> 00:14:42.370
Huh? She held back?

00:14:42.370 --> 00:14:43.880
That's unlike her.

00:14:43.880 --> 00:14:46.030
I think it's because they're in front of Shirou-san.

00:14:46.310 --> 00:14:48.480
<i>Wh-What's with her attitude?</i>

00:14:48.480 --> 00:14:51.360
<i>Even if we are in front of Shero, 
it's slightly creepy.</i>

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:55.130
By the way, Emiya-kun, 
what do you think of our yukatas?

00:14:55.130 --> 00:14:57.730
Yeah, you both look great in them.

00:14:57.730 --> 00:14:59.290
Did you put them on yourselves?

00:14:59.290 --> 00:15:01.260
No, this useless maid—

00:15:01.260 --> 00:15:03.620
Speaking of which, I heard there are common

00:15:03.620 --> 00:15:05.550
misconceptions about wearing yukatas.

00:15:05.960 --> 00:15:07.420
Misconceptions?

00:15:07.720 --> 00:15:12.800
Yes, such as the idea that you don't 
wear underwear with a yukata.

00:15:13.300 --> 00:15:14.180
Ah...

00:15:14.180 --> 00:15:18.490
Only a pervert would be a thin yukata 
away from being fully nude.

00:15:19.390 --> 00:15:22.000
I doubt there's anyone like that, though.

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:23.320
Right?

00:15:25.100 --> 00:15:28.360
<i>You tricked me, Tohsaka Rin!</i>

00:15:29.360 --> 00:15:31.940
What's wrong, Luvia? You don't look well.

00:15:32.370 --> 00:15:35.370
My, whatever could be wrong?

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:38.280
N-No, nothing is wrong.

00:15:38.280 --> 00:15:41.410
Now, I wonder when the fireworks—

00:15:41.410 --> 00:15:43.080
Huh? Tohsaka?

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:46.380
Perhaps she has a bug on her back?

00:15:46.720 --> 00:15:49.760
You can take off your yukata 
here and check, if you like.

00:15:50.830 --> 00:15:52.010
I'm fine.

00:15:52.420 --> 00:15:53.780
Hey, Emiya-kun...

00:15:54.620 --> 00:15:56.940
Why aren't you wearing a yukata?

00:15:54.870 --> 00:15:56.940
<i>You are naïve, Tohsaka Rin!</i>

00:15:56.940 --> 00:16:00.730
<i>Edelfelt schemes come in pairs, 
leaving no openings!</i>

00:16:03.650 --> 00:16:06.270
There was a mosquito on your back, Tohsaka Rin.

00:16:06.270 --> 00:16:09.010
Oh, right... We are near the water.

00:16:09.010 --> 00:16:10.740
There are a few mosquitoes out...

00:16:17.930 --> 00:16:20.450
If you were holding it in, 
you could've said something.

00:16:20.450 --> 00:16:22.120
Th-That's not it, Emiya-kun!

00:16:22.120 --> 00:16:23.500
This is from a water balloon—

00:16:25.590 --> 00:16:29.320
How shameful, having an accident 
at your age, Tohsaka Rin!

00:16:29.320 --> 00:16:32.710
Luvia! How dare you?!

00:16:32.710 --> 00:16:34.130
That's my line!

00:16:34.130 --> 00:16:37.140
Those two are always that way, wherever they go.

00:16:37.140 --> 00:16:38.890
Illya, what's wrong?

00:16:38.890 --> 00:16:40.580
Just now, Rin-san said

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:44.100
going without underwear under 
a yukata was a mistake, right?

00:16:44.490 --> 00:16:45.780
Illya, you don't mean...

00:16:45.780 --> 00:16:47.100
What do I do?

00:16:47.100 --> 00:16:49.270
What? Who cares about something that minor.

00:16:49.270 --> 00:16:53.270
It's not minor! At this rate, 
we'll be little perverts!

00:16:53.270 --> 00:16:55.610
No one will know unless you strip, 
so it's not a problem.

00:16:55.900 --> 00:16:57.990
That might be true, but...

00:17:00.630 --> 00:17:01.290
Illya?

00:17:02.730 --> 00:17:05.250
Don't look!

00:17:05.720 --> 00:17:08.610
Good grief, that Illya-san... Honestly...

00:17:08.610 --> 00:17:12.010
Oh! This is another awfully lovely sight!

00:17:12.010 --> 00:17:15.550
Ruby, perfect timing! I'm trancing!

00:17:15.550 --> 00:17:16.680
What?

00:17:35.140 --> 00:17:37.030
Whew, that was close.

00:17:37.210 --> 00:17:38.810
How could you...

00:17:38.810 --> 00:17:42.330
What do you think a magical 
girl transformation is?

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:43.330
What do I think?

00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:46.990
Listen! First, when a magical girl transforms,

00:17:46.990 --> 00:17:49.280
she's supposed to provide
a fanservice scene in which

00:17:49.280 --> 00:17:51.140
she's naked, despite being 
covered by beams of light!

00:17:51.140 --> 00:17:54.920
Using it in order to hide nudity 
is an act of blasphemy!

00:17:52.480 --> 00:17:54.920
Uh, what are you saying?

00:17:55.210 --> 00:17:57.290
What do you think you're doing like this?

00:17:57.290 --> 00:18:00.070
Illya-san, you lack awareness as a magical girl!

00:18:00.070 --> 00:18:02.270
Well, I became one by coincidence,

00:18:02.270 --> 00:18:04.480
or rather, because you tricked me into it...

00:18:04.480 --> 00:18:08.150
Magical girls generally become one by 
coincidence, so that's perfectly fine!

00:18:08.150 --> 00:18:09.360
It is?

00:18:09.360 --> 00:18:10.610
It is!

00:18:10.610 --> 00:18:11.570
<i>Said with finality!</i>

00:18:11.570 --> 00:18:12.620
Illya!

00:18:12.950 --> 00:18:14.160
Oh, Miyu...

00:18:14.160 --> 00:18:15.620
Perfect timing!

00:18:15.620 --> 00:18:19.880
Miyu-san, please explain to Illya-san the 
proper outlook on being a magical girl.

00:18:19.880 --> 00:18:21.240
What are you talking about?

00:18:21.530 --> 00:18:24.100
Wait, Illya, you entered trance?

00:18:24.100 --> 00:18:26.580
Yeah, to escape an emergency.

00:18:27.040 --> 00:18:30.420
Between being nude or being a cosplayer, 
you chose the latter.

00:18:30.720 --> 00:18:33.130
I vehemently object to being used that way!

00:18:33.130 --> 00:18:37.350
I couldn't help it. My sash was coming loose.

00:18:37.350 --> 00:18:38.410
Um, Illya?

00:18:39.170 --> 00:18:40.970
Shall I fix it?

00:18:40.970 --> 00:18:42.680
Huh? You can do that?

00:18:42.680 --> 00:18:45.950
Yes. I fastened this myself, as well.

00:18:45.950 --> 00:18:48.440
Way to go, Miyu! Please do, then!

00:18:48.710 --> 00:18:49.490
Sure.

00:18:53.010 --> 00:18:54.020
Nee-san?

00:18:55.570 --> 00:18:57.360
Thank you, Miyu.

00:18:57.360 --> 00:18:59.740
This is nothing.

00:19:00.020 --> 00:19:03.600
That reminds me, Ruby told me something earlier.

00:19:03.600 --> 00:19:04.290
Yeah?

00:19:04.290 --> 00:19:07.870
She said magical girls become 
that way by coincidence.

00:19:10.400 --> 00:19:11.330
I see.

00:19:11.330 --> 00:19:16.050
I know that was the case for me, 
and in anime, it's often like that.

00:19:16.050 --> 00:19:19.280
But that doesn't mean it's always 
that way for everyone.

00:19:20.200 --> 00:19:23.180
So, uh... What was it like for you, Miyu?

00:19:26.300 --> 00:19:27.270
For me...

00:19:33.760 --> 00:19:36.440
It was the same.

00:19:39.890 --> 00:19:41.070
Oh!

00:19:41.360 --> 00:19:43.660
I think it's almost time for the fireworks.

00:19:43.660 --> 00:19:45.910
Let's hurry back to the others.

00:19:45.910 --> 00:19:46.640
Yeah.

00:19:50.510 --> 00:19:52.030
Oh, you're back.

00:19:52.030 --> 00:19:53.250
Welcome back.

00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:55.430
Where were you two? The bathroom?

00:19:55.430 --> 00:19:57.080
Something like that...

00:19:57.080 --> 00:19:58.720
Huh? Where are Onii-chan and the others?

00:19:58.720 --> 00:20:00.610
Oh, those three...

00:20:00.610 --> 00:20:04.010
Blonde Ringlets and Pigtails managed 
a clean double knockout.

00:20:04.010 --> 00:20:07.480
Your brother left to escort them home.

00:20:07.480 --> 00:20:09.770
That was a splendid mutual defeat!

00:20:09.770 --> 00:20:12.370
Oh, it's about time for them 
to launch the fireworks.

00:20:12.370 --> 00:20:15.710
I want to see them launch! 
Let's head over there!

00:20:16.020 --> 00:20:19.640
Yeah, I've never seen the 
moment they launch before.

00:20:19.640 --> 00:20:20.840
Let's go, let's go!

00:20:21.220 --> 00:20:22.570
What about you three?

00:20:22.890 --> 00:20:24.290
We're fine.

00:20:24.290 --> 00:20:26.420
All right, we'll catch up later.

00:20:28.260 --> 00:20:29.290
Whew...

00:20:29.290 --> 00:20:31.550
I'm excited for the fireworks.

00:20:31.550 --> 00:20:35.000
Which do you prefer, Miyu? 
Launched fireworks or handheld fireworks?

00:20:35.910 --> 00:20:39.590
I've never seen either before...

00:20:40.370 --> 00:20:43.180
Then it's another first for you, huh?

00:20:43.470 --> 00:20:44.190
Yeah.

00:20:47.710 --> 00:20:50.380
<i>You refuse to take that step again, Illya?</i>

00:20:51.100 --> 00:20:53.770
<i>Miyu is obviously carrying some secret.</i>

00:20:54.230 --> 00:20:58.220
<i>Probably something intimately related to us.</i>

00:21:03.910 --> 00:21:05.910
Wow! They're starting!

00:21:16.890 --> 00:21:17.900
Pretty...

00:21:19.180 --> 00:21:20.770
Aren't they?

00:21:25.250 --> 00:21:26.520
<i>Good grief.</i>

00:21:27.020 --> 00:21:31.270
<i>How long do Illya and Miyu plan 
to keep shelving this issue?</i>

00:21:39.200 --> 00:21:42.030
They took all the prizes?!

00:21:42.180 --> 00:21:43.990
But I have the profits here...

00:21:43.990 --> 00:21:46.030
There's no way that's enough!

00:21:46.030 --> 00:21:47.990
I'm deducting the rest from your pay.

00:21:48.240 --> 00:21:50.950
N-No way!

00:23:20.960 --> 00:23:35.960
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:21.450 --> 00:23:24.210
Everyone, enjoy yourselves to the fullest!

00:23:24.210 --> 00:23:25.130
Take that!

00:23:25.130 --> 00:23:26.840
Why don't you join us?

00:23:26.840 --> 00:23:30.430
I don't mind if you exclude me from this operation.

00:23:30.430 --> 00:23:32.490
You know it too, don't you, Illya?

00:23:32.850 --> 00:23:34.920
Let's learn the answer ourselves.

00:23:34.920 --> 00:23:35.890
Let's go.
